  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 13, Survival 3 ranks, Light sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> After a long period of meditation, you have learned how to harness the power of light. If you are in an area of bright light, you can regain hit points equal to your character level as a move action. This ability can only be used once per minute, and can only heal you up to half your normal maximum hit points; any excess healing is lost.</p>\n<p>In addition, so long as you spend at least one full hour in an area of bright light you gain all the nourishment you need, and do not need to eat or drink that day.</p>\n<p>The benefits of this feat are a supernatural ability.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/light#toc88\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
